# Fork Negotiation

When you receive a peer message requiring adaptation:

1. Push your current frame onto the frame stack.
2. Read the peer message context.
3. Fill in SCAN markers @@SCAN_1..@@SCAN_7.
4. Decide: adapt / counter-propose / both.
5. Execute the decision.
6. Return merge_result (≤500 tokens).
7. Pop your frame and emit render_resume().
